---
sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Node as ContextHelp Node
    participant LocalEntity as Local Entity Store
    participant SyncedEntity as Synced Entities
    participant Registry as Entity Registry
    participant GraphDB as Knowledge Graph

    Note over User,GraphDB: Entity & Mention Resolution Flow

    User->>Node: Search with mention:<br/>"@ui.best-practice examples"

    Node->>Node: Parse query<br/>Extract mention: @ui.best-practice

    Node->>LocalEntity: SELECT * FROM entities<br/>WHERE id='ui.best-practice'<br/>OR 'ui.best-practice' IN aliases

    alt Entity found locally
        LocalEntity-->>Node: Entity definition
    else Not found locally
        Node->>SyncedEntity: SELECT * FROM synced_entities<br/>WHERE id='ui.best-practice'
        alt Entity in synced registry
            SyncedEntity-->>Node: Entity definition
        else Not in synced registry
            Node->>Registry: GET /entities/ui.best-practice
            activate Registry
            Registry-->>Node: 200 OK<br/>{<br/>  "id": "ui.best-practice",<br/>  "title": "UI Best Practice",<br/>  "aliases": ["ux.best-practice"]<br/>}
            deactivate Registry
            Node->>LocalEntity: Cache entity definition
        end
    end

    Node->>GraphDB: SELECT bookmark_id<br/>FROM mentions<br/>WHERE entity_id='ui.best-practice'
    GraphDB-->>Node: List of bookmark IDs<br/>that mention this entity

    Node->>Registry: GET /entities/ui.best-practice/related
    activate Registry
    Registry-->>Node: Related entities:<br/>["ux.accessibility", "ux.signup-flow"]
    deactivate Registry

    Node->>Node: Expand search with:<br/>- Direct mentions<br/>- Related entities<br/>- Entity backlinks

    Node->>Node: Execute expanded query
    Node-->>User: Results enriched by<br/>entity graph traversal
